{
    "title": "X Video Downloader & Player",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf1f <b>Fast & Private Video Downloader App. Save all videos and photos easily from the Internet.</b>\r\n\r\nX Video Downloader is a video and image downloader app to download videos from any website and social apps, such as TT(without watermark), FB, IG, and other social media.\r\n\r\nYou can browse the websites through the built-in browser in X Video Downloader, at the same time the app will auto-detect the video on the website. After downloading, the video can be played offline!\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Download videos from websites easily and fast.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Download videos from IG, Twit, TT, FB...\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Download TT videos without the watermark!\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Download by the built-in download manager and offline play them easily with the built-in player.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Excellent web browser experience!\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Support multiple type download formats: MP3, MP4, JPEG, PNG, etc. \r\n\ud83d\udc8e Different resolutions like 480p, 720p, 1080p or even HD.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Auto detect the videos you can download.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Check the download progress in the download bar.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Pause the download progress at any time.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Fast download speed!\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Movie downloader.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Browser downloader.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Support download background and download several files simultaneously.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Add bookmark for important or favorite websites in the built-in browser.\r\n\r\n<b>Downloader for Videos and photos</b>\r\nThis is an excellent downloader. It can download all videos and photos on the web. You can download and save whatever you want.\r\n\r\n<b>Social meida Downloader</b>\r\nYou can download videos from various social media directly in the browser. Or you can share the video link and download it with one click.\r\n\r\n<b>Browser Downloader</b>\r\nSupport detecting and downloading videos directly from the browser. When you browse videos on the web, the app will automatically detect them. You can download the video with just one click. \r\n\r\n<b>HD Video Downloader</b>\r\nX Video Downloader supports downloading HD videos. With this video downloader, you can enjoy a good viewing experience.\r\n\r\n<b>Downloading Manager</b>\r\nDownloading manager for the downloaded videos in X Video Downloader. You can manage to pause, resume and remove the download progress. Try downloading manager to manage your downloading videos!\r\n\r\n<b>Fast Video Downloader</b>\r\nPlease try this fast video downloader, if you want a high downloading speed downloader. It is a high speed, easy-to-use downloader in the market. \r\n\r\n<b>Safe and Privacy Downloader</b>\r\nX Video Downloader can keep your videos safe. Downloaded files can be stored in an encrypted vault where only you can see them.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udca1  How to download from websites? \ud83d\udca1</b>\r\n\u2460 Visit the website with the built-in browser in X Video Downloader\r\n\u2461 The videos and the images will be auto-detected, just tap the download button\r\n\u2462 Choose a video that you want to save\r\n\u2463 Done!\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udca1 How to download from social apps like IG or TT? \ud83d\udca1</b>\r\n\u2460 Open the social app and tap the Share icon\r\n\u2461 Tap Copy Link\r\n\u2462 Return to the X Video Downloader\r\n\u2463 Wait for the auto-detect and download\r\n\u2464 Video downloaded!\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer:</b>\r\n- Before re-uploading the video, please get the permission of the author of the video.\r\n- We are not responsible for intellectual property infringement by reposting someone else's content without permission.\r\n- Downloading of files is prohibited by national law and copyright is prohibited.\r\n- X Video Downloader is not officially associated with Instagram, Facebook, Twitter, TikTok, etc.",
